OL,3,ABBC drops Drag Race UK after eight
OL,4,Aseries
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrag Race UK is leaving the BBC after
OL,7,Feight series, the broadcaster has
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the channel said it
OL,11,Fwas facing "very difficult choices" in
OL,12,Fthe face of "significant financial
OL,13,Fpressures".
OL,15,FThe show, presented by RuPaul, is
OL,16,Fcurrently broadcast on BBC Three and
OL,17,FiPlayer. Future series - as well as its
OL,18,Fspin-off vs The World - will be
OL,19,Fbroadcast on Wow Presents Plus, a
OL,20,Fstreaming platform owned by the
OL,21,Fproduction company behind the show.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
